We can write the comparison as $\begin{aligned}
\mathrm{money,\ things,\ status} &\longrightarrow D,\\
\mathrm{God,\ truth,\ enlightenment} &\longrightarrow D.\end{aligned}$ The notation is intentionally spare. It does not equate money with truth. It says that desire can attach to either field.

